{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Narrative</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/b02d01995e16fe682d80f7f2cccbe6cb.avif?t=1773915072\" width=1518 height=846 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a deeply emotional, story-driven journey, told through evocative visuals, haunting music, and subtle environmental storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill Yet Engaging Combat</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/81f438c5e8477220481a9d68930d1ef2.avif?t=1773915072\" width=1518 height=850 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a simple but weighty combat system that flows naturally with exploration, keeping the tension without overwhelming you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety of Weapons</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/6ce2806b4249c03cece741a534813af5.avif?t=1773915072\" width=1514 height=848 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of weapons, from close-range melee tools to ranged firearms, to fend off the shadowy figures lurking in Yus\u2019s mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Mind Like No Other</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/2589676eb1f4b20cb055093965a34245.avif?t=1773915072\" width=1520 height=846 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an environment shaped entirely by Yus\u2019s thoughts, a place where reality twists, logic bends, and nothing is quite what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles with Purpose</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/cc3e15d9af8a8e909f2abf951036f3a2.avif?t=1773915072\" width=1518 height=848 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within this surreal world lie mysterious puzzles, even Yus himself doesn\u2019t understand them. Solve them to uncover secrets and help him confront his deepest fears.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961950?t=1773915072","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/d0d39a7ae04eddba91bf22bb46e1b084f7dceb5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773915072","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/ce921e7d93aa105ae6d6a71f03bbc07549fe234c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773915072","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/ce921e7d93aa105ae6d6a71f03bbc07549fe234c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773915072","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game features mild blood during combat and deals with emotional themes such as loss, grief, and coping with trauma."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Narrative</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/b02d01995e16fe682d80f7f2cccbe6cb.avif?t=1773915072\" width=1518 height=846 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a deeply emotional, story-driven journey, told through evocative visuals, haunting music, and subtle environmental storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill Yet Engaging Combat</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat